  "manuscript_sentences": {
    "main_result": "Independent validation from the Swiss Avalanche Bulletin confirms the loaded-gun mechanism: human experts rate danger 'considerable' or higher on 46% of SSW station-days versus 37% of controls (OR = 1.49; n = 38,742 station-days; P $<$ 10$^{-10}$), yet observed natural avalanche activity is simultaneously suppressed (gmRR = 0.32). This paradox\u2014elevated forecast danger coupled with suppressed natural release\u2014is the operational fingerprint of the loaded-gun mechanism, independently confirmed by human-expert assessment.",
